Moekoma: the source API of Mihon

The code in this folder comes from Mihon (https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon),
at the commit d001e6f of 2026-10-21. Mihon is under the Apache License 2.0,
which is in LICENSE.

Moekoma changed these files:

- source/model/SMangaImpl.kt and source/model/SChapterImpl.kt: an empty
  JsonObject replaces JsonObject.EMPTY of mihon.core.common.
- source/model/FilterList.kt: the Compose annotation @Stable is removed.
- network/NetworkHelper.kt: written again for Moekoma. It has no Cloudflare
  web view for Cloudflare, no DNS over HTTPS, and no logs. Its public parts are the same.
- network/interceptor/CloudflareInterceptor.kt: written again. It finds the
  browser check of Cloudflare and gives a fault. It does not open a web view.
- network/interceptor/UncaughtExceptionInterceptor.kt: it also catches a
  LinkageError, such as an error in the start of a class of an extension.
- AppInfo.kt: written again. It gives the version of Moekoma.

The other files are as in Mihon.
